+</dl>
+<dl><dt><strong>id</strong></dt>
+<dd><tt>Return&nbsp;the&nbsp;unique&nbsp;id&nbsp;string&nbsp;for&nbsp;this&nbsp;tab&nbsp;object.</tt></dd>
+</dl>
