+Opens&nbsp;and&nbsp;reads&nbsp;url,&nbsp;assuming&nbsp;the&nbsp;contents&nbsp;are&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;simple&nbsp;DEPS-like&nbsp;file<br>
