+&nbsp;&nbsp;A&nbsp;list&nbsp;of&nbsp;string&nbsp;paths&nbsp;starting&nbsp;under&nbsp;src&nbsp;that&nbsp;are&nbsp;required&nbsp;by&nbsp;the<br>
