+&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;enable_chrome_trace:&nbsp;a&nbsp;boolean&nbsp;that&nbsp;specifies&nbsp;whether&nbsp;to&nbsp;enable<br>
+&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;chrome&nbsp;tracing.<br>
