+&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;class&nbsp;follows&nbsp;the&nbsp;<a href="#ResultsWrapperInterface">ResultsWrapperInterface</a>.&nbsp;Note:&nbsp;this&nbsp;class&nbsp;is&nbsp;not<br>
